    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d12-a1">

                <pb facs="0125" n="13" sameAs="frus:frus1918/pg13"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                        Minister in Nicaragua</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Jefferson</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1914-01-21T12:00:00-05:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">January 21, 1914, noon.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Referring to Department’s instruction of December 2, No. 8, regarding
                    Honduran-Nicaraguan boundary award of arbitration, cable present status of your
                    representations to Foreign Office in premises and what reply, if any, made by
                    Nicaraguan Government.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Bryan</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
